  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "In the table shown, the formula relating \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) is:\n\n  \\(x\\)  \\(1\\)  \\(2\\)  \\(3\\)  \\(4\\)  \\(5\\)\n\n  \\(y\\)  \\(3\\)  \\(7\\)  \\(13\\)  \\(21\\)  \\(31\\)",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(y=4x-1\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(y=x^3-x^2+x+2\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(y=x^2+x+1\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(y=(x^2+x+1)(x-1)\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "None of these"
